  "title": "Fall Showcase",
  "canonical": "https://www.spindlesunited.com/2025-fall-showcase",
  "description": "2025 Fall Showcase Sign up Below! The 2025 Fall Showcase hosted by Spindles United FC Sunday, November 2, 2025 1-3pm | $5 per player (Cash, Card or Venmo) Alumni Field, Cohoes…",
  "bodyHtml": "<figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/ca013b0a-4e77-4e67-81b6-26162cd37003/6-20+CHS-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h2 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">2025 Fall Showcase</h2></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/f3d33f69-39fb-4b94-a0bc-40131502cd32/fall-showcase.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Sign up Below!</h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The 2025 Fall Showcase hosted by Spindles United FC</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>Sunday, November 2, 2025</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>1-3pm | $5 per player (Cash, Card or Venmo)</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://maps.apple/p/zeNRibInHomCyx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Alumni Field, Cohoes High School</em></strong></a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span><strong>2-Hour Scrimmage Session</strong></span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>1:00pm</em></strong><em> - Intro and Warm up</em></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>1:15pm</em></strong><em> - Split into teams, start 11v11 scrimmages (format will depend on number of players)</em></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>3:00pm</em></strong><em> - Closing</em></p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/8d092131-02bb-4fee-a022-213daaaa477b/12-2+Scarves-096.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Win a Free Scarf!</span></h3></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Two players at the 2025 Fall Showcase will be randomly selected for a FREE Spindles Scarf</span></p></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/89b3bda9-981a-4cee-9d33-cf1bb28be4c5/Fall+Showcase+copy+2.png?format=original\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">To cap off 2025, Spindles is hosting our first open showcase of the off season.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">As held in the past, this scrimmage-based event is an opportunity for players to show their <strong><em>interest in joining Spindles in 2026.</em></strong></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Spindles United operates on a Clean-Slate system each season to help level the playing field for both former and potential players.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong><em>Sign up to save your spot!</em></strong></p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Player Registration</h3><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">All players registered agree to the <a href=\"/s/fall-showcase-waiver-2025.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Waiver of Liability</a> and to pay $5 at the door.</p></div><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span>Alumni Field</span></h3></div><figure><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/fd965b9b-9352-47ca-a966-11edad577a00/6-20+CHS-02.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Home of the 2025 Grassroots Cup, Alumni Field of Cohoes High School is a brand new turf stadium.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The perfect field for a rain or shine session.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"https://maps.apple/p/zeNRibInHomCyx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Alumni Field, Cohoes High School</em></strong></a></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">1 Tiger Circle</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Cohoes, NY</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">12047</p></div><figure><a href=\"/news/2023-spring-tryouts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/9aa22673-dee3-4872-9e9e-fcd28c0a13d6/spring-tryouts-76.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"Group of young soccer players and coaches on a soccer field posing for a team photo in front of a goalpost, wearing team jerseys and training vests.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"/news/2023-spring-tryouts\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2023 Spring Tryouts</a></h3></div><figure><a href=\"/news/2024-fall-showcase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/67f8bcbf-1e94-4eba-b004-43b4616ff313/Screenshot+2025-01-05+at+11.10.03%E2%80%AFAM.png?format=original\" alt=\"Soccer players practicing on a field, wearing pink and green jerseys with &#x27;SPINDLES UNITED&#x27; written on them, with buildings in the background.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"/news/2024-fall-showcase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2024 Fall Showcase</a></h3></div><figure><a href=\"/news/2024-fall-showcase\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/6702f19a9e93b178e9d17b01/3d8a5494-d66b-4112-8749-26e34c86d667/1-19-winter-showcase-70.jpg?format=original\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></figure><div class=\"sqs-html-content\"><h3 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><a href=\"/news/the-winter-showcase-recap\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">2025 Winter Showcase</a></h3></div>",
